Value Filldown INSTANCE (\S+)
Value Filldown ROUTER_ID (\S+)
Value Filldown VRF (\S+)
Value Required AREA (\S+)
Value AREA_TYPE (\S+)

# One record per area of each instance, joined onto the interface and neighbour rows for the
# router ID and the area type (feature 011, research R2). LSA, SPF, throttle and threshold lines
# are not captured (FR-007).
Start
  ^OSPF instance -> Continue.Record
  ^OSPF instance ${INSTANCE} with ID ${ROUTER_ID} VRF ${VRF}$$
  ^\s+Area \S+$$ -> Continue.Record
  ^\s+Area ${AREA}$$
  ^\s+It is a ${AREA_TYPE} area
